{"speciesId":117,"names":{"fr":"Hypocéan","es":"Seadra","en":"Seadra","ja":"シードラ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"red","text":"Capable of swim­ ming backwards by rapidly flapping its wing-like pectoral fins and stout tail."},{"language":"en","version":"blue","text":"Capable of swim­ ming backwards by rapidly flapping its wing-like pectoral fins and stout tail."},{"language":"en","version":"yellow","text":"Touching the back fin causes numb­ ness. It hooks its tail to coral to stay in place while sleeping."},{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"An examination of its cells revealed the presence of a gene not found in HORSEA. It became a hot topic."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"Its fin-tips leak poison. Its fins and bones are highly valued as ingredients in herbal medicine."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"The male raises the young. If it is approached, it uses its toxic spikes to fend off the intruder."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"SEADRA sleeps after wriggling itself between the branches of coral. Those trying to harvest coral are occasionally stung by this POKéMON’s poison barbs if they fail to notice it."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"SEADRA generates whirlpools by spinning its body. The whirlpools are strong enough to swallow even fishing boats. This POKéMON weakens prey with these currents, then swallows it whole."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"The poisonous barbs all over its body are highly valued as ingredients for making traditional herbal medicine. It shows no mercy to anything approaching its nest."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"Its body bristles with sharp spikes. Carelessly trying to touch it could cause fainting from the spikes."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"It is capable of swimming backwards by rapidly flapping its winglike pectoral fins and stout tail."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"Its spines provide protection. Its fins and bones are prized as traditional medicine ingredients."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"Its spines provide protection. Its fins and bones are prized as traditional medicine ingredients."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"Its spines provide protection. Its fins and bones are prized as traditional medicine ingredients."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"An examination of its cells revealed the presence of a gene not found in HORSEA. It became a hot topic."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"Its fin-tips leak poison. Its fins and bones are highly valued as ingredients in herbal medicine."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Son épine dorsale le protège. Ses os et ses nageoires sont très prisés en médecine traditionnelle."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"Its spines provide protection. Its fins and bones are prized as traditional medicine ingredients."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Son épine dorsale le protège. Ses os et ses nageoires sont très prisés en médecine traditionnelle."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"Its spines provide protection. Its fins and bones are prized as traditional medicine ingredients."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Its spines provide protection. Its fins and bones are prized as traditional-medicine ingredients."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Its spines provide protection. Its fins and bones are prized as traditional-medicine ingredients."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Son corps est recouvert de pointes tranchantes. Il faut la plus grande attention pour le saisir, sous peine de se faire piquer."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Las afiladas púas que le recubren el cuerpo se le erizan y pueden causar el debilitamiento con solo tocarlo."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Its body bristles with sharp spikes. Carelessly trying to touch it could cause fainting from the spikes."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"うかつに 触ろうとすると 体中に 生える トゲに 刺されて 気絶することもある。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il peut nager à l’envers en agitant ses petites nageoires pectorales."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Puede nadar hacia atrás moviendo rápidamente las aletas pectorales y la robusta cola que tiene."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It is capable of swimming backwards by rapidly flapping its winglike pectoral fins and stout tail."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"羽と 尻尾を 素早く 動かし 前を 向いたまま 後ろへ 泳ぐこともできる ポケモン。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Hypocéan s’accroche aux récifs de corail avant de s’endormir. Les pêcheurs de coraux se font parfois piquer par les aiguillons de ce Pokémon lorsqu’ils ne font pas attention."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Seadra se echa a dormir tras abrirse un hueco entre las ramas de los corales. Los pescadores de coral suelen pincharse con las púas venenosas de estos Pokémon si no los ven."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Seadra sleeps after wriggling itself between the branches of coral. Those trying to harvest coral are occasionally stung by this Pokémon’s poison barbs if they fail to notice it."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"サンゴの 枝の すき間に 潜って 眠る。 シードラに 気づかず サンゴを 取ろうとして 毒の トゲに 刺されてしまう ことが ある。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Hypocéan déclenche des tourbillons en faisant tournoyer son corps. Ces tourbillons sont assez puissants pour engloutir des bateaux de pêche. Ce Pokémon affaiblit sa proie grâce à ces courants, puis l’avale en une bouchée."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Seadra gira sobre sí mismo y crea unos remolinos lo suficientemente fuertes como para engullir barcos de pesca. Este Pokémon aprovecha las corrientes que crea para debilitar a su presa y tragársela de una vez."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Seadra generates whirlpools by spinning its body. The whirlpools are strong enough to swallow even fishing boats. This Pokémon weakens prey with these currents, then swallows it whole."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"体を 回転させて 渦巻きを つくる。 漁船も のみこまれる ほどの 激流で 獲物を 弱らせてから 丸ごと のみこむ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Le contact de ses nageoires dorsales engourdit. Il ancre sa queue au corail quand il dort pour éviter que le courant ne l’emporte."},{"language":"es","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Tocar sus aletas dorsales causa entumecimiento. Mientras duerme se agarra al coral con la cola para que no se lo lleve la corriente."},{"language":"en","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Touching the back fin causes numbness. It hooks its tail to coral to stay in place while sleeping."},{"language":"ja","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"背びれに さわると 痺れてしまう。 眠るときは 流されないように シッポを さんごに 巻きつける。"},{"language":"fr","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"Le contact de ses nageoires dorsales engourdit. Il ancre sa queue au corail quand il dort pour éviter que le courant ne l’emporte."},{"language":"es","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"Tocar sus aletas dorsales causa entumecimiento. Mientras duerme se agarra al coral con la cola para que no se lo lleve la corriente."},{"language":"en","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"Touching the back fin causes numbness. It hooks its tail to coral to stay in place while sleeping."},{"language":"ja","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"背びれに さわると 痺れてしまう。 眠るときは 流されないように シッポを さんごに 巻きつける。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Les mâles s’occupent des petits, et tant qu’ils en ont à élever, le venin contenu dans leurs épines dorsales devient beaucoup plus fort."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"En esta especie, es el macho quien se ocupa de la prole. Durante la época de cría, el veneno de las púas de su espalda se vuelve más potente."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"It’s the males that raise the offspring. While Seadra are raising young, the spines on their backs secrete thicker and stronger poison."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"オスが 子どもを 育てる。 子育て中は 背中の トゲの 毒素が 強く 濃くなるのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Sa puissance de succion est si forte qu’il peut aspirer en un instant ses proies pour les manger, même si elles sont plus grosses que sa bouche."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Su estrecho morro posee tal fuerza de succión que es capaz de aspirar presas de mayor tamaño y engullirlas enteras."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"Seadra’s mouth is slender, but its suction power is strong. In an instant, Seadra can suck in food that’s larger than the opening of its mouth."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"細い 口だが 吸引力は 強い。 口より 大きな エサも 一瞬で 吸いこみ 食べるぞ。"}],"varieties":[{"id":117,"moves":[{"name":"headbutt","learns":[[3,"machine",0],[4,"machine",0],[10,"tutor",0],[19,"machine",0]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[1,"machine",0],[2,"machine",0],[28,"machine",0],[29,"machine",0]]},{"name":"double-edge","learns":[[1,"machine",0],[2,"machine",0],[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[13,"tutor",0],[28,"machine",0],[29,"machine",0]]},{"name":"leer","learns":[[1,"level-up",24],[2,"level-up",24],[3,"level-up",1],[3,"level-up",15],[4,"level-up",1],[4,"level-up",15],[5,"level-up",1],[5,"level-up",15],[6,"level-up",1],[6,"level-up",15],[7,"level-up",1],[7,"level-up",15],[8,"level-up",1],[8,"level-up",8],[9,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",8],[10,"level-up",1],[10,"level-up",8],[11,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",8],[12,"level-up",1],[12,"level-up",15],[13,"level-up",1],[13,"level-up",15],[14,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",8],[15,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",8],[16,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",9],[17,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",9],[18,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",9],[19,"level-up",1],[19,"level-up",15],[20,"level-up",1],[23,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1],[28,"level-up",24],[29,"level-up",24]]},{"name":"disable","learns":[[19,"level-up",1],[25,"egg",0]]},{"name":"water-gun","learns":[[1,"level-up",30]